      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nOccupying a superb position in the long-established and highly regarded residential area of Yellowbatter on the north side of Drogheda, this attractive home enjoys the perfect balance of convenience and community. Situated just off the Ballymakenny Road, the property is within walking distance of a wide range of everyday amenities, educational facilities, healthcare services and recreational amenities, making it an ideal choice for families, first-time buyers and commuters alike.\r\n\r\nThe area is particularly well served by an excellent selection of schools, including Presentation Primary School and Ballymakenny College, together with a number of other primary and secondary schools located throughout Drogheda.\r\n\r\nResidents benefit from close proximity to Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital, Drogheda Town Centre, local shopping facilities, cafés, restaurants, pharmacies, sports clubs and childcare services. The nearby Boyne Rugby Football Club, local parks and a variety of leisure facilities provide excellent opportunities for outdoor recreation and community engagement.\r\n\r\nDrogheda town offers an abundance of retail, cultural and sporting amenities, while excellent transport connections ensure effortless commuting. The M1 Motorway is just a five-minute drive away, providing swift access to Dublin Airport (approximately 32km) and Dublin City Centre (approximately 48km). Drogheda's extensive bus network and mainline rail services further enhance the property's accessibility for those travelling to Dublin, Belfast and beyond.\r\n\r\nCombining a mature residential setting with exceptional convenience, this sought-after location continues to be one of Drogheda's most popular addresses for owner-occupiers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nProperty\r\n\r\nOriginally constructed in the 1950s, this attractive two-storey residence has recently undergone a comprehensive renovation, creating a stylish and turnkey home ideal for first-time buyers, families, investors, or those seeking a property close to Drogheda town centre.\r\n\r\nInternally, the accommodation is well laid out and briefly comprises an entrance hallway, spacious sitting room, kitchen, bathroom, and utility room at ground floor level. Upstairs there are three bedrooms and a contemporary shower room.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a private enclosed rear garden complete with a block-built domestic shed, while the front garden is laid in lawn and provides an attractive approach to the home.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nGround Floor\r\nEntrance Hall: 6.00m x 1.88m\r\nSitting Room: 4.00m x 4.31m\r\nKitchen: 1.72m x 2.78m\r\nBathroom: 1.72m x 1.89m\r\nUtility Room: 1.87m x 1.24m\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding: 1.90m x 3.50m\r\nBedroom 1: 3.61m x 4.13m\r\nBedroom 2: 2.24m x 3.11m\r\nBedroom 3: 2.44m x 2.56m\r\nShower Room: 1.75m x 1.90m\r\nServices\r\nMains Water\r\nMains Sewage\r\nMains Electricity\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nBER\r\n\r\nBER Rating: C3\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nRecently renovated throughout\r\nThree-bedroom mid-terrace residence\r\nPopular and mature residential location\r\nEnclosed rear garden with block-built shed\r\nWalking distance to Drogheda town centre\r\nClose to Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital\r\nExcellent access to M1 Motorway\r\nIdeal starter home or investment opportunity\r\nTurnkey condition\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. For further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Declan today."
